1
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:04,046
KHUSUS STAF

2
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:08,426
Berhenti bicara omong kosong!

3
00:00:09,135 --> 00:00:12,262
Aku yakin kau juga monster!

4
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:13,514
Kondo!

5
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:20,520
Hei, sedang apa kau?

6
00:00:20,521 --> 00:00:24,942
Ashihara bersaudara. Kalian juga, ya?
Jangan mendekat!

7
00:02:02,331 --> 00:02:03,998
{\an8}DEVILS' CREST

8
00:02:03,999 --> 00:02:08,170
{\an8}EPISODE 4: KECURIGAAN

9
00:02:09,755 --> 00:02:11,631
Apa maksudmu, Gamo?

10
00:02:11,632 --> 00:02:14,008
Kenapa kau pikir kami monster?

11
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:16,636
Tak ada penjelasan lain!

12
00:02:16,637 --> 00:02:19,807
Kau membunuh makhluk besar itu, bukan?

13
00:02:20,391 --> 00:02:23,768
Siapa pun yang bisa melakukannya
pasti adalah monster.

14
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:27,230
Kami punya orang-orang yang terluka
di dalam barikade.

15
00:02:27,231 --> 00:02:28,941
Kalian tak boleh masuk!

16
00:02:29,567 --> 00:02:33,152
Kurasa lebih baik
kita bernegosiasi dengan Ohno.

17
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:34,821
Aku tahu apa rencanamu.

18
00:02:34,822 --> 00:02:37,615
Kau akan bertransformasi seperti Watamaki

19
00:02:37,616 --> 00:02:39,577
dan menyerang kami, bukan?

20
00:02:42,788 --> 00:02:47,625
Ohno, kau lihat Watamaki bertransformasi?

21
00:02:47,626 --> 00:02:49,168
Ya, aku melihatnya.

22
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:51,422
Semua orang di sini melihatnya.

23
00:02:51,922 --> 00:02:54,341
Watamaki keluar dari Caliculus,

24
00:02:54,884 --> 00:02:56,802
berubah menjadi monster tanpa wajah,

25
00:02:57,344 --> 00:02:59,346
lalu menyerang Beroshi.

26
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,098
Apa kalian...

27
00:03:01,807 --> 00:03:03,851
Apa kalian meninggalkan Beroshi mati?

28
00:03:04,935 --> 00:03:08,606
Kondo, tutup mulutmu.
Kau tak tahu apa yang terjadi.

29
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:11,608
Tada dan Aida berada di toko
dengan luka parah

30
00:03:11,609 --> 00:03:14,319
karena perbuatan Watamaki.

31
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:18,072
<i>Jika Beroshi tak di sana,
makin banyak yang akan mati.</i>

32
00:03:18,073 --> 00:03:20,451
<i>Dia mempertaruhkan nyawanya
untuk melindungi kami.</i>

33
00:03:20,951 --> 00:03:23,495
<i>Tak ada pilihan lain! Kami harus lari!</i>

34
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:27,498
Lalu kami pergi ke lobi,

35
00:03:27,499 --> 00:03:31,003
tapi menemukan monster besar itu
sedang mengamuk.

36
00:03:34,632 --> 00:03:36,424
<i>Kami membawa Tada dan Aida kemari</i>

37
00:03:36,425 --> 00:03:39,303
<i>dan nyaris tak tiba dengan selamat.</i>

38
00:03:39,887 --> 00:03:41,054
<i>Gamo benar.</i>

39
00:03:41,055 --> 00:03:44,475
<i>Tak ada manusia normal
yang bisa mengalahkan makhluk besar itu.</i>

40
00:03:45,392 --> 00:03:50,605
Jadi, sebelum membuktikan
bahwa kalian adalah manusia,

41
00:03:50,606 --> 00:03:52,650
kami tak akan biarkan kalian masuk.

42
00:03:53,692 --> 00:03:56,320
Kami mengalahkan
lebih dari makhluk kepala lancip itu.

43
00:03:57,613 --> 00:03:59,948
Kami juga mengamankan Watamaki

44
00:03:59,949 --> 00:04:01,825
saat menemukannya di Ruang Bermain.

45
00:04:02,409 --> 00:04:07,831
Kami menguburkan Miura di dalam Caliculus.

46
00:04:10,459 --> 00:04:11,585
Beroshi...

47
00:04:12,211 --> 00:04:13,462
Dia mati?

48
00:04:23,472 --> 00:04:24,431
Beroshi...

49
00:04:25,432 --> 00:04:27,308
Hei, Kembar.

50
00:04:27,309 --> 00:04:30,312
Lupakan semua itu.
Apa maksudmu "mengamankan"?

51
00:04:33,023 --> 00:04:35,734
Lupakan semua itu?

52
00:04:36,443 --> 00:04:38,861
Apa yang kau lakukan kepada Watamaki?

53
00:04:38,862 --> 00:04:41,447
Jangan bilang kau membunuhnya!

54
00:04:41,448 --> 00:04:42,992
Kami tak membunuh Watamaki.

55
00:04:43,492 --> 00:04:46,203
Namun, tak akan mudah...

56
00:04:47,579 --> 00:04:49,706
menjelaskan perbuatan kami kepadanya.

57
00:04:49,707 --> 00:04:52,208
Berhenti omong kosong. Kalian adalah...

58
00:04:52,209 --> 00:04:54,003
Gamo, tutup mulut sebentar!

59
00:05:00,092 --> 00:05:04,095
Apa katamu? Aku ketua kelas.

60
00:05:04,096 --> 00:05:06,765
Kau yang paling harus tutup mulut!

61
00:05:15,858 --> 00:05:17,775
Ketua kelas apa?

62
00:05:17,776 --> 00:05:20,611
Saat Beroshi diserang oleh Watamaki,

63
00:05:20,612 --> 00:05:22,948
kau lari tanpa menolong sedikit pun.

64
00:05:26,827 --> 00:05:29,704
Lalu tadi, kami yang menahan barikade

65
00:05:29,705 --> 00:05:31,874
sementara kau bersembunyi di belakang.

66
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,546
Itu karena...

67
00:05:39,048 --> 00:05:40,798
Aku pemimpin.

68
00:05:40,799 --> 00:05:44,052
Jika aku mati,
siapa yang akan menjaga kelas kita?

69
00:05:44,053 --> 00:05:47,264
Aku yang menemukan tempat aman ini!

70
00:05:50,559 --> 00:05:51,602
Baiklah.

71
00:05:52,436 --> 00:05:56,732
Kami hadapi Kondo dan Ashihara bersaudara
meski mereka mungkin monster.

72
00:05:57,399 --> 00:06:00,527
Pemimpin seharusnya di tempat aman, bukan?

73
00:06:03,572 --> 00:06:07,868
Jika kau mau hadapi mereka, silakan.

74
00:06:08,452 --> 00:06:13,123
Namun, jangan pernah biarkan
mereka bertiga masuk.

75
00:06:18,504 --> 00:06:20,630
Dia bilang ini tempat aman,

76
00:06:20,631 --> 00:06:23,383
tapi sama sekali tak aman.

77
00:06:23,967 --> 00:06:28,137
Hei, Yu, jika Conehead lain
menyerang lagi,

78
00:06:28,138 --> 00:06:31,475
barikade itu tak akan bertahan.

79
00:06:36,563 --> 00:06:37,397
Selain itu...

80
00:06:38,315 --> 00:06:41,317
apa hanya itu yang bisa kau pakai?

81
00:06:41,318 --> 00:06:42,944
Itu hanya jaket.

82
00:06:42,945 --> 00:06:44,404
Diam.

83
00:06:44,988 --> 00:06:47,241
Ashihara, katakan apa yang terjadi.

84
00:06:47,825 --> 00:06:49,784
Apa yang kau lakukan kepada Watamaki?

85
00:06:49,785 --> 00:06:53,038
Jika kau tak membunuhnya,
bagaimana dia berhenti menyerang?

86
00:06:55,916 --> 00:06:57,042
Aku memakai sihir.

87
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:19,356
Baik, biar kucoba.

88
00:07:22,151 --> 00:07:23,109
Bisa.

89
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:24,194
Apa?

90
00:07:27,573 --> 00:07:29,574
Jika kami memakai QREST seperti kalian,

91
00:07:29,575 --> 00:07:31,784
kami bisa mengangkat palu itu?

92
00:07:31,785 --> 00:07:32,828
Mungkin.

93
00:07:33,579 --> 00:07:34,954
Bagaimana caranya?

94
00:07:34,955 --> 00:07:36,706
Apa harus membayar atau semacamnya?

95
00:07:36,707 --> 00:07:38,333
Tak perlu membayar!

96
00:07:39,084 --> 00:07:40,169
Kuberi tahu caranya.

97
00:07:40,836 --> 00:07:44,046
Namun, ini sangat penting.

98
00:07:44,047 --> 00:07:45,841
Aku mau menjelaskan ke seluruh kelas.

99
00:07:47,718 --> 00:07:51,013
Baik. Aku akan meyakinkan Gamo.

100
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:23,754
<i>Jadi, 17 orang selamat.</i>

101
00:08:24,796 --> 00:08:26,339
Di mana yang lainnya?

102
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,590
Kami tak tahu.

103
00:08:27,591 --> 00:08:31,844
Apa semua orang turun
dari Ruang Bermain lantai dua bersama?

104
00:08:31,845 --> 00:08:34,722
Tidak. Liftnya tak bekerja

105
00:08:34,723 --> 00:08:36,891
dan tangga dipenuhi orang.

106
00:08:36,892 --> 00:08:40,270
Yang di belakang naik ke lantai tiga.

107
00:08:40,979 --> 00:08:42,689
<i>Para gadis seperti Fujikawa...</i>

108
00:08:43,607 --> 00:08:44,858
<i>...dan Teragami.</i>

109
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:47,277
<i>Lalu para pria seperti Niki,</i>

110
00:08:47,861 --> 00:08:49,738
<i>Haizaki, dan sisa dari grup itu.</i>

111
00:08:50,405 --> 00:08:51,949
Lantai tiga...

112
00:08:53,659 --> 00:08:56,619
Meski ada monster lain di lantai tiga,

113
00:08:56,620 --> 00:09:00,957
kurasa Niki atau Haizaki
tak akan kalah semudah itu.

114
00:09:00,958 --> 00:09:03,125
Kenapa kau biarkan mereka masuk?

115
00:09:03,126 --> 00:09:05,587
Apa yang akan kau lakukan?
Mereka berbahaya.

116
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:14,804
Kau bilang kami bisa
memakai kekuatan dengan QREST.

117
00:09:14,805 --> 00:09:16,098
Bagaimana caranya?

118
00:09:22,688 --> 00:09:25,648
Hei, jangan berlama-lama. Katakanlah.

119
00:09:25,649 --> 00:09:28,527
Ya, kami sedang sibuk.

120
00:09:51,341 --> 00:09:54,302
Setelah kami mengalahkan
monster kepala lancip,

121
00:09:54,303 --> 00:09:56,763
kami memeriksa situasi di pintu masuk.

122
00:09:57,389 --> 00:10:00,224
Kami coba memecahkan jendela,
tak ada yang berhasil.

123
00:10:00,225 --> 00:10:03,728
Tentu saja pecundang sepertimu
tak akan bisa melakukannya.

124
00:10:03,729 --> 00:10:05,313
Bukan Yu.

125
00:10:05,314 --> 00:10:09,651
Aku memukulnya dengan palu ini,
bahkan retak saja tidak.

126
00:10:21,455 --> 00:10:23,081
Aku memercayainya.

127
00:10:23,999 --> 00:10:25,249
Si bodoh itu.

128
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:29,338
Mungkin bukan hanya jendela
dan pintu otomatis yang tak bisa dirusak.

129
00:10:29,921 --> 00:10:32,340
Semua kaca di lobi berwarna hitam pekat,

130
00:10:32,341 --> 00:10:34,300
jadi kami tak bisa lihat keluar,

131
00:10:34,301 --> 00:10:36,303
dan QREST tak mau terkoneksi ke jaringan.

132
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:41,015
Dengan kata lain,
kecuali kita tahu apa penyebabnya,

133
00:10:41,016 --> 00:10:43,727
mustahil lolos dari Altea.

134
00:10:51,943 --> 00:10:56,155
Untuk sekarang, kita harus menjaga
tempat perlindungan yang ada

135
00:10:56,156 --> 00:10:59,283
dan memberi semua orang kekuatan
untuk melakukannya.

136
00:10:59,284 --> 00:11:00,702
Itu prioritas utama kita.

137
00:11:01,203 --> 00:11:03,621
Itu bukan keputusanmu.

138
00:11:03,622 --> 00:11:06,499
Aku ketua kelas
dan yang menemukan tempat ini.

139
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:09,878
Jelas, aku yang memutuskan
langkah berikutnya!

140
00:11:11,088 --> 00:11:12,089
Ventus!

141
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:24,851
Avis!

142
00:11:32,359 --> 00:11:33,527
Ignis!

143
00:11:48,875 --> 00:11:51,795
Itu mantra, bukan?

144
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:53,879
Dari Actual Magic.

145
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,591
Mustahil. Itu pasti trik.

146
00:11:57,884 --> 00:11:59,136
Kurasa bukan.

147
00:12:01,054 --> 00:12:03,557
Aku merasakan angin tadi.

148
00:12:04,516 --> 00:12:07,977
QREST tak mendukung rasa sentuhan,

149
00:12:07,978 --> 00:12:11,064
jadi jika kita merasakan
udara bergerak, itu bukan AR.

150
00:12:11,815 --> 00:12:13,691
Itu bukan trik.

151
00:12:13,692 --> 00:12:15,651
Itu sihir asli.

152
00:12:15,652 --> 00:12:20,656
Jadi, kau memakai sihir
untuk mengalahkan monster itu?

153
00:12:20,657 --> 00:12:23,659
Bukan hanya itu. Watamaki juga.

154
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:24,910
Tidak.

155
00:12:24,911 --> 00:12:27,288
Kami membunuh monsternya.

156
00:12:27,289 --> 00:12:28,415
Namun, Watamaki...

157
00:12:29,666 --> 00:12:31,835
Kami hanya menahannya
agar tak bisa bergerak.

158
00:12:32,335 --> 00:12:36,673
Aku akan mencari cara
mengubah kembali Watamaki.

159
00:12:37,174 --> 00:12:38,591
Mengubah kembali Watamaki?

160
00:12:38,592 --> 00:12:40,594
Apa itu mungkin?

161
00:12:41,178 --> 00:12:42,762
Kurasa mungkin ada cara.

162
00:12:43,597 --> 00:12:45,098
Pasti ada.

163
00:12:47,184 --> 00:12:48,101
Baiklah.

164
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,896
Ashihara, aku memercayaimu.

165
00:12:51,897 --> 00:12:54,648
Mulai kini, aku akan ikuti perintahmu.

166
00:12:54,649 --> 00:12:56,359
Terima kasih, Ohno.

167
00:12:58,195 --> 00:13:02,616
Baiklah. Kuajari kalian
cara memakai sihir.

168
00:13:08,955 --> 00:13:11,249
<i>Haruskah aku melakukan ini?</i>

169
00:13:18,215 --> 00:13:19,299
Yu?

170
00:13:29,059 --> 00:13:31,353
Baiklah, mari mulai.

171
00:13:42,989 --> 00:13:45,199
Kini semua orang berubah

172
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:48,203
menjadi kelas yang mereka pilih
selama uji coba Actual Magic.

173
00:13:48,787 --> 00:13:49,787
Serius?

174
00:13:49,788 --> 00:13:53,208
{\an8}YOICHI OHNO - HARUKI HOKARI
TAKESHI MORO - TAKATO SERA

175
00:13:53,959 --> 00:13:57,711
Mage dan priest
seharusnya bisa memakai mantra mereka,

176
00:13:57,712 --> 00:14:00,047
warrior juga lebih kuat,

177
00:14:00,048 --> 00:14:02,842
lalu thief dan hunter
seharusnya bergerak lebih cepat.

178
00:14:11,685 --> 00:14:12,894
Ashihara.

179
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:16,063
Maaf memperlakukanmu seperti monster tadi.

180
00:14:16,064 --> 00:14:18,691
Tidak, aku tak menyalahkanmu.

181
00:14:18,692 --> 00:14:20,025
Namun, aku kesal.

182
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:22,069
Jika kami tahu lebih awal,

183
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:25,031
mungkin kami bisa menyelamatkan Beroshi.

184
00:14:28,368 --> 00:14:31,078
Kenapa kau tertawa?

185
00:14:31,079 --> 00:14:33,622
Mau bagaimana lagi? Kalah ya kalah.

186
00:14:33,623 --> 00:14:35,332
Mereka tim yang lebih baik.

187
00:14:35,333 --> 00:14:36,792
Namun...

188
00:14:36,793 --> 00:14:39,128
Jangan cemas, Yoi.

189
00:14:39,129 --> 00:14:42,590
Suatu hari nanti,
aku akan jadi penjaga terbaik di liga

190
00:14:42,591 --> 00:14:44,633
dan membantumu memenangkan pertandingan.

191
00:14:44,634 --> 00:14:45,927
Beroshi.

192
00:14:47,137 --> 00:14:48,679
Dengar, pemain cadangan!

193
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,182
Aku kaptennya dan jangan merendahkanku!

194
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:55,186
Semua aman, bukan?

195
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:01,484
Beroshi!

196
00:15:02,152 --> 00:15:04,863
Pergi! Yoi!

197
00:15:05,363 --> 00:15:06,823
Ohno!

198
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:16,165
Beroshi menyelamatkan kami semua.

199
00:15:16,166 --> 00:15:18,376
Kami berutang kepadanya untuk keluar.

200
00:15:20,170 --> 00:15:21,420
Tolong dengar.

201
00:15:21,421 --> 00:15:25,425
Jika ada yang memilih kelas priest,
tolong angkat tangan.

202
00:15:26,926 --> 00:15:28,053
Aku.

203
00:15:31,056 --> 00:15:32,474
Aku juga!

204
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:35,560
Jangan sombong.

205
00:15:36,061 --> 00:15:38,020
Hanya tiga?

206
00:15:38,021 --> 00:15:40,648
Ya. Lebih sedikit daripada dugaan.

207
00:15:40,649 --> 00:15:42,274
Shimizu, Soga,

208
00:15:42,275 --> 00:15:45,653
dan Moro seharusnya
bisa memakai sihir penyembuh.

209
00:15:45,654 --> 00:15:48,114
Aku ingin kalian merawat yang terluka.

210
00:15:49,032 --> 00:15:51,951
Benar. Kami bisa menyembuhkan
dengan sihir.

211
00:15:56,289 --> 00:15:57,123
Moro.

212
00:15:58,291 --> 00:15:59,542
Ya?

213
00:16:01,211 --> 00:16:04,380
Tolong. Sembuhkan Tada dan Aida.

214
00:16:04,381 --> 00:16:06,841
Beroshi menyerahkan nyawa
demi melindungi mereka.

215
00:16:08,134 --> 00:16:10,094
Ohno meminta tolong kepada Mo-yan?

216
00:16:10,095 --> 00:16:11,763
Sulit kupercaya.

217
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,101
Baik. Akan kucoba.

218
00:16:19,104 --> 00:16:20,730
Mo-yan sangat keren!

219
00:16:21,606 --> 00:16:23,692
Bagaimana mantranya?

220
00:16:24,609 --> 00:16:26,569
Apa kau bercanda?

221
00:16:33,201 --> 00:16:34,202
Sacre!

222
00:16:40,166 --> 00:16:41,042
Premis!

223
00:16:43,628 --> 00:16:46,965
Fusione! Holy Healing!

224
00:16:58,852 --> 00:17:00,061
Sudah tak sakit!

225
00:17:01,229 --> 00:17:02,771
Sebenarnya, sakit sedikit.

226
00:17:02,772 --> 00:17:04,190
Tunggu, sakit atau tidak?

227
00:17:05,775 --> 00:17:07,610
Aku baik-baik saja.

228
00:17:08,570 --> 00:17:10,071
Sihir memang luar biasa!

229
00:17:10,697 --> 00:17:12,197
Kita berhasil!

230
00:17:12,198 --> 00:17:14,032
Tolong, pasien berikutnya!

231
00:17:14,033 --> 00:17:16,786
Kau terdengar seperti dokter
daripada priest.

232
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,418
Rasa sakitnya sungguh hilang!

233
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,962
Baiklah, tapi tenang!

234
00:17:27,547 --> 00:17:29,381
Kau luar biasa, Mo-yan!

235
00:17:29,382 --> 00:17:30,633
Sulit kupercaya!

236
00:17:32,469 --> 00:17:35,512
Sejak hari ini,
kalian bisa memanggilku Grand Priest.

237
00:17:35,513 --> 00:17:37,055
Jangan sombong.

238
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:39,308
Itu sungguh luar biasa.

239
00:17:39,309 --> 00:17:41,310
Beri aku tips nanti, ya?

240
00:17:41,311 --> 00:17:43,061
Aku juga, tolong.

241
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:44,856
Bagus, Moro!

242
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,482
Teman-Teman...

243
00:17:46,483 --> 00:17:48,526
Kami mengandalkanmu, Grand Priest!

244
00:17:49,652 --> 00:17:50,944
Ya!

245
00:17:50,945 --> 00:17:52,113
Yu!

246
00:17:55,325 --> 00:17:56,701
Apa itu?

247
00:18:10,465 --> 00:18:12,133
Yu, jangan bergerak!

248
00:18:24,187 --> 00:18:26,064
Apa? Itu berhasil?

249
00:18:26,689 --> 00:18:28,316
Itu kerusakan area.

250
00:18:29,901 --> 00:18:33,488
Semuanya, serangga-serangga ini
mudah dibunuh jika dipukul keras...

251
00:18:40,912 --> 00:18:43,413
Kami akan tangani ini sendiri.

252
00:18:43,414 --> 00:18:45,582
Sawa, tendang ulatnya.

253
00:18:45,583 --> 00:18:47,668
Konken, hancurkan mereka dengan palu.

254
00:18:47,669 --> 00:18:48,919
Baik!

255
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,088
Bagaimana denganmu?

256
00:18:50,588 --> 00:18:52,340
Aku bantu dengan ini.

257
00:18:58,555 --> 00:19:01,975
LARVA TABANUS HELLFLY

258
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,061
Kita bisa!

259
00:19:14,821 --> 00:19:16,573
<i>Hanya tujuh atau delapan lagi.</i>

260
00:19:20,702 --> 00:19:23,453
Ashihara! Tolong Ruki!

261
00:19:23,454 --> 00:19:25,498
Cepat! Kumohon!

262
00:19:35,133 --> 00:19:37,384
POIN STATUS +3
POIN SKILL +40

263
00:19:37,385 --> 00:19:38,719
Sudah berakhir.

264
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,387
Ruki!

265
00:19:40,388 --> 00:19:41,638
Mungkin racun.

266
00:19:41,639 --> 00:19:43,348
Apa dia akan mati?

267
00:19:43,349 --> 00:19:45,851
Tidak, mungkin racun pelumpuh.

268
00:19:45,852 --> 00:19:47,145
Tunggu saja sebentar.

269
00:19:47,687 --> 00:19:50,355
Ashihara, Tomori...

270
00:19:50,356 --> 00:19:53,734
Tomochi melindungiku,

271
00:19:53,735 --> 00:19:56,361
tapi aku hanya bisa lari.

272
00:19:56,362 --> 00:19:58,822
Itu bukan salahmu, Tsuda.

273
00:19:58,823 --> 00:20:01,284
Aku juga tak bisa apa-apa.

274
00:20:01,910 --> 00:20:04,620
Soga, bisakah gunakan
mantra penawar racun?

275
00:20:04,621 --> 00:20:06,830
Ya. Kurasa begitu.

276
00:20:06,831 --> 00:20:09,666
Lalu coba kepada Shimizu.

277
00:20:09,667 --> 00:20:10,960
Baik.

278
00:20:12,128 --> 00:20:13,171
Sacre.

279
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,964
Pluvia.

280
00:20:16,382 --> 00:20:17,592
Tersus.

281
00:20:18,885 --> 00:20:21,554
Holy Purification!

282
00:20:30,647 --> 00:20:32,357
Tomochi!

283
00:20:32,899 --> 00:20:34,650
Terima kasih, Soga.

284
00:20:34,651 --> 00:20:36,693
Terima kasih, Ashihara.

285
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:37,903
Tak perlu.

286
00:20:37,904 --> 00:20:39,780
Yang terpenting, kau bisa bergerak,

287
00:20:39,781 --> 00:20:41,323
kau dan Soga harus berpencar

288
00:20:41,324 --> 00:20:43,700
dan menyembuhkan mereka yang lumpuh.

289
00:20:43,701 --> 00:20:45,620
Baik. Aku sudah tak apa.

290
00:20:46,329 --> 00:20:47,663
Di mana Moro?

291
00:20:47,664 --> 00:20:50,040
Moro tak di sini!

292
00:20:50,041 --> 00:20:52,417
Ashihara, di sini.

293
00:20:52,418 --> 00:20:54,837
KHUSUS STAF

294
00:21:08,017 --> 00:21:09,227
Mo-yan?

295
00:21:11,646 --> 00:21:13,313
Apa itu?

296
00:21:13,314 --> 00:21:15,108
Kepompong?

297
00:21:16,651 --> 00:21:17,694
Konken, hancurkan!

298
00:21:22,365 --> 00:21:24,658
TABANUS HELLFLY

299
00:21:24,659 --> 00:21:28,203
Sepuluh detik lagi akan menetas.

300
00:21:28,204 --> 00:21:30,163
Kau tak apa, Moro?

301
00:21:30,164 --> 00:21:32,207
Kau aman sekarang.

302
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:36,128
Shimizu atau Soga bisa menyembuhkanmu.

303
00:21:36,129 --> 00:21:38,089
Apa kau bisa berdiri, Mo-yan?

304
00:21:46,681 --> 00:21:47,849
Ada apa?

305
00:21:48,558 --> 00:21:49,767
Dia mati!

306
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:28,907
IBLIS

307
00:23:28,908 --> 00:23:30,158
<i>Lindungi mereka.</i>

308
00:23:30,159 --> 00:23:31,618
<i>Tak perlu sebanyak ini.</i>

309
00:23:31,619 --> 00:23:34,830
<i>Siapa yang mengizinkanmu memerintah?</i>

310
00:23:34,831 --> 00:23:35,956
<i>Rasionya naik.</i>

311
00:23:35,957 --> 00:23:36,957
<i>Aku melihatnya.</i>

312
00:23:36,958 --> 00:23:39,251
<i>Setelah itu, dia menolong Sera dan Hokari.</i>

313
00:23:39,252 --> 00:23:40,794
<i>Ada yang aneh di sini!</i>

314
00:23:40,795 --> 00:23:43,004
<i>Senang bertemu, Yuumy.</i>

315
00:23:43,005 --> 00:23:44,089
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Andrianto

316
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:45,091
Supervisor Kreasi
Kiki Alek

